erefore false. A repaired C66-TATE-SUPPORT must either name a specific base or atlas, or retain the FND-0167 hypotheses (H-S) including the j=6 corner Gr^W_12 H_c^{12}(S;Q). The exhibited class is the third FND-0167 summand Gr^W_12 H_c^{12}(S)(-2), realised as a Kunneth summand of H_c^{16}(U) itself on a product family, not a lift of Gr^W_16 H_c^{16}(S); FND-0171, which blocks transport of the j=8 first summand through the corner injection on a pure-dimension-15 atlas, does not apply. Not asserted: any computation of the global kernel K, any conclusion about a fixed 15-dimensional atlas of Hbar^bal, or any statement about RED-0001.
